{"3887470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Maid Cafe Coop", "steam_appid": 3887470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maid Cafe Coop is a game where you can become a maid with your friends, take it chill or feel the stress of attending a shop with demanding customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/fcdda7541a1063bfd773350b9d147517.poster.avif?t=1785258982\" width=586 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/fcdda7541a1063bfd773350b9d147517.webm?t=1785258982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/fcdda7541a1063bfd773350b9d147517.mp4?t=1785258982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join games or invite your friends over, work together or cause mayhem, watch your friends become the <strong>moest</strong> maids of them all</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Entertain customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/5404c7d637738b7adf4dbf03e0a4d6c8.poster.avif?t=1785258982\" width=588 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/5404c7d637738b7adf4dbf03e0a4d6c8.webm?t=1785258982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/5404c7d637738b7adf4dbf03e0a4d6c8.mp4?t=1785258982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no maid cafe without a <i>moe moe kyun~!</i> blessing and more. Interact with your customers as they request your attention to make them happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/aad03bb38adeb05b6bd31a46f376d2a8.poster.avif?t=1785258982\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/aad03bb38adeb05b6bd31a46f376d2a8.webm?t=1785258982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/aad03bb38adeb05b6bd31a46f376d2a8.mp4?t=1785258982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the extensive character customization, pick your outfit, give yourself tails and ears, set your height and have fun with other <i>special</i> sliders</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make many drinks and foods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/7e7a8d851ee898c7519b7fea716bfdd7.poster.avif?t=1785258982\" width=586 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/7e7a8d851ee898c7519b7fea716bfdd7.webm?t=1785258982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/7e7a8d851ee898c7519b7fea716bfdd7.mp4?t=1785258982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new drink and food types that you will have to prepare yourself using different tools and machines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/f5adf9be57a21af5396bf1255fdbfc64.poster.avif?t=1785258982\" width=586 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/f5adf9be57a21af5396bf1255fdbfc64.webm?t=1785258982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/f5adf9be57a21af5396bf1255fdbfc64.mp4?t=1785258982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from a small and cramped cafe into a proper large maid cafe with idol shows filled with moe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Concerts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/560ed9a90876c0d914b524731711cc48.poster.avif?t=1785258982\" width=586 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/560ed9a90876c0d914b524731711cc48.webm?t=1785258982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/560ed9a90876c0d914b524731711cc48.mp4?t=1785258982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in dances and idol shows stealing the hearts of all your customers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887470/extras/933b26bfce7c27d4f895eba21daa50bb.poster.avif?t=1785258982\" width=586 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com